            of groupoids as discussed above, then the action functional is naturally expressed as the homotopy filling a completion of the span to a square diagram over
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
