              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-morphisms"} 2-morphisms
                  are morphism of spans compatible with the maps to
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
