            %p
              The prequantum field theory defined by a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+character"} group character
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
