                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A
            then its
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/category+of+modules"} category of modules
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi A
                  %mi Mod
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A Mod
            behaves much like a higher analog of a
            = succeed "/" do
