          %p
            Then we saw
            %a{:href => "#Local2dTQFT"} above
            for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+TQFT"} 2d TQFT
            that in higher dimensional general such a circle in turn may appear
          .maruku-equation
