              SCFT as an extended functorial field theory
            %p
              On the (conjectural) suggestion to view at least some aspects of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D%3D6+N%3D%282%2C0%29+SCFT"} D=6 N=(2,0) SCFT
